 w new Aggies everything our community has to offer. From shopping and dini
 ng to arts and culture\, this is where first impressions turn into lifelon
 g favorites. \n\n\n\nLet’s roll out the Aggie welcome mat and make sure 
 Downtown Davis is the place they’ll want to keep coming back to!
